hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1790","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey bulaaya taake unkey liye maghfirat maangein. To unhon-ne apne sar mor liye. (Bukhari: 4903)"
"1791","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ghazwe mein tha aur main ne Abdullah bin Ubayy ko kehtey huey suna: Jo Rasulullah key paas hain un par kharch na karo yahan tak ke wo uskey gird se muntashir ho jaaein. Aur beshak agar ham uskey paas se wapas aey to izzat wala us mein se zaleel ko zaroor nikaalega. To main ne uska apne chacha ya Umar se zikr kya. To us ne uska Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya. To Aap ne mujhey bulaaya aur main ne Aap ko bayan kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdullah bin Ubayy aur uskey sahaaba ki taraf bheja. To unhon-ne qasam khai ke unhon-ne nahi kaha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey jhutlaaya aur use sacha kaha. To mujhey gham pahuncha jo mujhey us jaisa kabhi nahi pahuncha tha. To main ghar mein baitha. To merey chacha ne mujh se kaha: Tum ne kya chaaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhey jhutlaaya aur tum se nafrat ki. To Allah Taala ne naazil farmaya: (Jab munaafiq tumhaarey paas aaein). To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne meri taraf bheja aur padha. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne tumhey sacha kaha ae Zaid! (Bukhari: 4900)"
"1792","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Zaid Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Ae Allah! Ansaar aur Ansaar key beton ko maaf farma! Aur raawi ko Ansaar key beton key beton mein shak hua. (Bukhari: 4906). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Ae Nabi! Tum kyun haraam kartey ho jo Allah ne tumhaarey liye halaal kya hai) aayat."
